<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline"><div><p class="eyebrow">Digital Product Manager / Systems builder</p><h1 id="headline">Product thinking.<br /><span>Systems fluency.</span></h1><p class="intro">I'm Andrew Gallagher. I turn complex insurance operations into practical digital workflows, and keep my technical skills grounded by building and running my own infrastructure.</p>
